---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { repoUrl, issuesUrl, discussionsUrl } from "../site";
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Why LibreDental exists, its commitment to staying free and open source, and how to get involved."
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>About LibreDental</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      LibreDental is a fast, open-source dental practice management system that
      gives practices full ownership of their software and their patient data.
    </p>

    <h2>Why it exists</h2>
    <p>
      Dental practices need modern practice management software they can rely
      on without being locked in. LibreDental runs natively on your own
      computers, works without depending on anyone's cloud, and stores its data
      in files you can back up yourself.
    </p>

    <h2>Our commitment</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        The core of LibreDental will always be free and open source under the
        Apache 2.0 license.
      </li>
      <li>
        We will never put updates behind fees, restrict self-hosting, require
        license keys, or relicense the core under restrictive terms.
      </li>
      <li>
        Your data belongs to you. Local installations will never be throttled,
        feature-gated, or made dependent on third-party cloud servers.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Get involved</h2>
    <p>
      Contributions are welcome from developers, dental professionals,
      designers and open-source advocates.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href={repoUrl}>Source code on GitHub</a>, including the contribution guide in the README</li>
      <li><a href={issuesUrl}>Report a bug or request a feature</a></li>
      <li><a href={discussionsUrl}>Ask questions and join the discussion</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
